## ⚠️ Rebrand gotchas

1. **Two head/layout files.** `apps/web/app/root.tsx` is the *active* React-Router root;
   `apps/web/app/layout.tsx` is a parallel legacy Next-style layout with the **same** meta/favicon
   config. Update both (or delete the unused one) — otherwise OG/favicon output is inconsistent.
2. **19 locales.** Brand copy in §1F / §5F is the English source; the same keys exist in
   `cs, de, es, fr, id, it, ja, ko, pl, pt-BR, ro, ru, sk, tr-TR, ua, vi-VN, zh-CN, zh-TW` and must all change.
3. **Pre-existing typo `planes.so`** (extra "s") in template privacy/terms placeholders — see §3 & §5F.
4. **License headers** — ~2,400 files carry `Copyright (c) 2023-present Plane Software, Inc.` (never
   rendered; change only if the legal entity is rebranded) — see §1G.
5. **Orphaned brand assets** under `apps/web/app/assets/plane-logos/` + `plane-takeoff.png` are
   unreferenced in `apps/web` — see §4C.
6. **Customer showcase logos** (Accenture, Dolby, Sony, Zerodha) render on the auth screen — see §4B.
   Third-party marks; likely *removed* in a rebrand, not replaced.
7. **Multiple, inconsistent PWA manifests** — see §2.2.

